# FONT BINARIES NEVER GET COMMITTED.
# Publishing a font file to a public repo redistributes it, which almost no
# font licence allows, free ones included: "free for commercial use" means you
# may SET type with it, not that you may hand the file to everyone who visits.
# Drop whatever you like into fonts/ to try it locally; git will not take it.
# The README in there is the exception, because it is instructions, not a font.
fonts/*
!fonts/README.txt

